ctiveVersion\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":34},{"title":"getAllVersions\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":35},{"title":"getLatestVersion\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":36},{"title":"getVersion\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":37},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":39},{"title":"Configuring target metrics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/configuring-target-metrics-trained-classification-solution.md","line":69},{"title":"Predictive model components","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/predictive-intelligence.md","line":205},{"title":"Configuring target metrics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/configuring-target-metrics-trained-classification-solution.md","line":217},{"title":"ClassificationSolution","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":309},{"title":"DatasetDefinition\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DatasetDefinitionAPI.md","line":368},{"title":"Encoded query strings","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-user-interface/c_EncodedQueryStrings.md","line":436},{"title":"Domain separation and Predictive Intelligence","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/domain-separation-predictive-intelligence.md","line":444},{"title":"Encoder - Encoder\\(Object config\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/EncoderAPI.md","line":452},{"title":"Create a custom stopwords list","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/create-custom-stopwords-list.md","line":535},{"title":"ClassificationSolution","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":650},{"title":"Predictive model components","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/predictive-intelligence.md","line":777},{"title":"Configuring target metrics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/configuring-target-metrics-trained-classification-solution.md","line":815},{"title":"\n        {\n          \"precision\": \"39.33\",\n          \"coverage\": \"95.31\",\n          \"recall\": \"54.69\",\n          \"selected\": \"false\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"precision\": \"100\",\n          \"coverage\": \"0\",\n          \"recall\": \"0\",\n          \"selected\": \"false\"\n        },\n     ...\n    }\n    ...\n  \"excludedClasses\": {\n    \"ACE\": {\n      \"distribution\": \"0.11\",\n      \"rowCount\": \"9\"\n    },\n    \"AHA\": {\n      \"distribution\": \"0.01\",\n      \"rowCount\": \"1\"\n    }, \n    ...\n}\n```\n\n## ClassificationSolutionVersion - getVersionNumber\\(\\)\n\nGets the version number of a solution object.\n\n|Name|Type|Description|\n|----|----|-----------|\n|None| | |\n\n|Type|Description|\n|----|-----------|\n|String|Version number.|\n\nThe following example shows how to get a version number.\n\n```\n// Get version number\nvar mlSolution = sn_ml.ClassificationSolutionStore.get('ml_incident_categorization');\n\ngs.print(\"Version number: \"+JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(mlSolution.getActiveVersion().getVersionNumber()), null, 2));\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```\nVersion number: 1\n```\n\n## ClassificationSolutionVersion - predict\\(Object input, Object options\\)\n\nGets the input data for a prediction.\n\n<table id=\"table_wwz_pbw_plb\" class=\"parameters\"><thead><tr><th>\n\nName\n\n</th><th>\n\nType\n\n</th><th>\n\nDescription\n\n</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>\n\ninput\n\n</td><td>\n\nObject\n\n</td><td>\n\n[GlideRecord","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideRecordAPI.md","line":928},{"title":"Configuring target metrics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/configuring-target-metrics-trained-classification-solution.md","line":1268},{"title":"getTrainingStatistics\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionVersionAPI.md","line":1314}],"metadata":{"title":"ClassificationSolutionVersion - Global","description":"The ClassificationSolutionVersion API is a scriptable object used in Predictive Intelligence stores.Calculates solution precision and coverage.Gets estimated precision, estimated coverage, estimated recall values from the ML Solutions \\[ml\\_solution\\] table and records from the Class Confidence \\[ml\\_class\\] table.Gets solution object properties and version number.Gets training completion status.Gets all the training statistics for a given solution.Gets the version number of a solution object.Gets the input data for a prediction.Sets precision, coverage, or recall values at solution level or class level.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionVersionAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":12,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[75,137],[166,171],[175,181],[209,219],[225,254],[258,262],[285,331],[372,379],[405,412],[493,567],[572,576],[600,657],[716,721],[725,732],[736,743],[747,753],[782,792],[799,817],[826,875],[882,903],[908,912],[955,971],[976,980],[982,1027],[1077,1087],[1096,1133],[1148,1152],[1175,1179],[1193,1197],[1240,1274],[1323,1328]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionVersionAPI.md"},
