ontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":15},{"title":"getVersion\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":16},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":18},{"title":"Configuring target metrics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/configuring-target-metrics-trained-classification-solution.md","line":48},{"title":"Predictive model components","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/predictive-intelligence.md","line":184},{"title":"Configuring target metrics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/configuring-target-metrics-trained-classification-solution.md","line":196},{"title":"ClassificationSolution","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":288},{"title":"DatasetDefinition\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/DatasetDefinitionAPI.md","line":347},{"title":"Encoded query strings","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-user-interface/c_EncodedQueryStrings.md","line":415},{"title":"Domain separation and Predictive Intelligence","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/domain-separation-predictive-intelligence.md","line":423},{"title":"Encoder - Encoder\\(Object config\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/EncoderAPI.md","line":431},{"title":"Create a custom stopwords list","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/create-custom-stopwords-list.md","line":514},{"title":"ClassificationSolution","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionAPI.md","line":629},{"title":"Predictive model components","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/predictive-intelligence.md","line":756},{"title":"Configuring target metrics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/configuring-target-metrics-trained-classification-solution.md","line":794},{"title":"\n        {\n          \"precision\": \"39.33\",\n          \"coverage\": \"95.31\",\n          \"recall\": \"54.69\",\n          \"selected\": \"false\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"precision\": \"100\",\n          \"coverage\": \"0\",\n          \"recall\": \"0\",\n          \"selected\": \"false\"\n        },\n     ...\n    }\n    ...\n  \"excludedClasses\": {\n    \"ACE\": {\n      \"distribution\": \"0.11\",\n      \"rowCount\": \"9\"\n    },\n    \"AHA\": {\n      \"distribution\": \"0.01\",\n      \"rowCount\": \"1\"\n    }, \n    ...\n}\n```\n\n## ClassificationSolutionVersion - getVersionNumber\\(\\)\n\nGets the version number of a solution object.\n\n|Name|Type|Description|\n|----|----|-----------|\n|None| | |\n\n|Type|Description|\n|----|-----------|\n|String|Version number.|\n\nThe following example shows how to get a version number.\n\n```\n// Get version number\nvar mlSolution = sn_ml.ClassificationSolutionStore.get('ml_incident_categorization');\n\ngs.print(\"Version number: \"+JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(mlSolution.getActiveVersion().getVersionNumber()), null, 2));\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```\nVersion number: 1\n```\n\n## ClassificationSolutionVersion - predict\\(Object input, Object options\\)\n\nGets the input data for a prediction.\n\n<table id=\"table_wwz_pbw_plb\" class=\"parameters\"><thead><tr><th>\n\nName\n\n</th><th>\n\nType\n\n</th><th>\n\nDescription\n\n</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>\n\ninput\n\n</td><td>\n\nObject\n\n</td><td>\n\n[GlideRecord","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideRecordAPI.md","line":907},{"title":"Configuring target metrics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/configuring-target-metrics-trained-classification-solution.md","line":1247},{"title":"getTrainingStatistics\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionVersionAPI.md","line":1293}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
