01\",\n      \"rowCount\": \"1\"\n    }, \n    ...\n}\n```\n\n## ClassificationSolutionVersion - getVersionNumber\\(\\)\n\nGets the version number of a solution object.\n\n|Name|Type|Description|\n|----|----|-----------|\n|None| | |\n\n|Type|Description|\n|----|-----------|\n|String|Version number.|\n\nThe following example shows how to get a version number.\n\n```\n// Get version number\nvar mlSolution = sn_ml.ClassificationSolutionStore.get('ml_incident_categorization');\n\ngs.print(\"Version number: \"+JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(mlSolution.getActiveVersion().getVersionNumber()), null, 2));\n```\n\nOutput:\n\n```\nVersion number: 1\n```\n\n## ClassificationSolutionVersion - predict\\(Object input, Object options\\)\n\nGets the input data for a prediction.\n\n<table id=\"table_wwz_pbw_plb\" class=\"parameters\"><thead><tr><th>\n\nName\n\n</th><th>\n\nType\n\n</th><th>\n\nDescription\n\n</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>\n\ninput\n\n</td><td>\n\nObject\n\n</td><td>\n\n[GlideRecord","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideRecordAPI.md","line":174},{"title":"Configuring target metrics","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/intelligent-experiences/configuring-target-metrics-trained-classification-solution.md","line":514},{"title":"getTrainingStatistics\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ClassificationSolutionVersionAPI.md","line":560}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
